  "rationale": "We approve the claim because no exclusions or flags apply and the automated findings confirm the loss occurred within the policy period without late notice. Clause STD-2.1 governs this decision by providing collision coverage for direct and accidental loss to the covered vehicle during the policy period. The key fact is that the claimant's vehicle suffered $7,620.00 in collision damages when another driver struck the rear of the car.",
